# Prompt additions require README changelog updates

When adding, removing, or materially changing prompt-library entries, update the changelog in `README.md` in the same change set.

- Add a dated, concise summary that names the affected prompts and their categories.
- State whether new entries include result images when that affects their availability in the library.
- Keep `README.en.md` aligned when its content is maintained alongside the Chinese README.
- Do not rewrite older changelog entries solely for formatting.
